; specs/t27os/actor_graph.t27 -- the actor graph LAW (pure logic, no drawing - FR-004)
; The actor graph surface paints supervision relationships and message flow among Queen actors.
; ---
; WHAT IS DECIDED HERE: node identity and state, edge classes, restart semantics, message counters,
; zoom/shell interplay, and fullscreen layout. It never draws, only computes. glass_window.t27
; reads this contract to render; actor_view.t27 provides the TE_* fixture test data.
; FR-004: a new surface just needs to call these functions, it does not reimplement them.
; ASCII only (L3). phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

